export function createTutorialState(lessonId='select-deploy') {
 if (!TUTORIAL_LESSONS.some(x=>x.id===lessonId)) throw new Error('Unknown tutorial lesson: '+lessonId);
 return {lessonId,stepIndex:0,attempts:0,complete:false};
}
function lookupShip(context,id) {return context.game?.ships?.find(s=>s.id===id);}
function lookupPlan(context,id) {return context.plans?.[id]||{moves:[],torps:[],main:[],planes:[],sweep:null};}
function normalCell(E,value) {
 if(value&&typeof value==='object'&&Number.isFinite(value.q)&&Number.isFinite(value.r))return value;
 if(typeof value==='string'&&/^-?\d+,-?\d+$/.test(value)){const [q,r]=value.split(',').map(Number);return {q,r};}
 if(typeof value==='string'&&/^[A-S](?:[1-9]|1[0-5])$/i.test(value))return E.fromCR(value.toUpperCase().charCodeAt(0)-65,Number(value.slice(1))-1);
 return null;
}
function same(E,a,b) {return !!a&&!!b&&E.same(a,b);}
function events(context) {return (context.game?.log||[]).filter(e=>e.round===context.game.round-1);}
function match(E,c,context,action) {
 const p=c.shipId?lookupPlan(context,c.shipId):null,s=c.shipId?lookupShip(context,c.shipId):null;
 switch(c.kind) {
  case 'all':return c.conditions.every(x=>match(E,x,context,action));
  case 'event':return c.types.includes(action?.type)&&(!c.shipId||action.shipId===c.shipId)&&(!c.cell||same(E,normalCell(E,action.target??action.cell),c.cell))&&(c.saved===undefined||action.saved===c.saved);
  case 'selected':return context.selected===c.shipId;
  case 'shipAt':return same(E,s?.pos,c.cell);
  case 'phase':return context.game?.phase===c.value;
  case 'planMoves':return p.moves.length===c.count;
  case 'routeEnd':return !!s&&same(E,E.route(s,p,context.game.map).at(-1)?.pos,c.cell);
  case 'moveAt':return p.moves[c.index]?.turn===c.turn&&p.moves[c.index]?.forward===c.forward;
  case 'mainCount':return p.main.length===c.count;
  case 'overlay':return context.showRanges===true&&(!context.rangeMode||context.rangeMode==='all'||context.rangeMode===c.rangeMode);
  case 'visibleCell':return E.visibleCells(context.game,0).has(E.key(c.cell))===c.value;
  case 'fogCell':{const v=E.visibleCells(context.game,0).has(E.key(c.cell)),known=(context.game.explored?.[0]||[]).includes(E.key(c.cell));return (v?'visible':known?'explored':'unexplored')===c.state;}
  case 'round':return context.game.round>=c.atLeast;
  case 'reload':return !!s&&(s.mainReady>context.game.round)===c.value;
  case 'mainStack':return p.main.length===c.count&&p.main.every(h=>same(E,h,c.cell));
  case 'collisionResolved':return c.shipIds.every(id=>{const u=lookupShip(context,id);return u&&u.hp<u.cfg.hp&&events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes(u.label)&&e.text.includes('发生碰撞'))&&events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes(u.label)&&e.text.includes('沿原路回退'));})&&!events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes('驱逐-1')&&e.text.includes('发射鱼雷'));
  case 'secondaryResolved':return !!s&&events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes('遭'+s.label+'副炮命中'));
  case 'mainResolved':{const t=lookupShip(context,c.targetId);return !!s&&!!t&&events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes(t.label)&&e.text.includes('遭主炮命中 −'+c.damage));}
  case 'torpAt':return p.torps.some(t=>t.window===c.window&&t.dir===c.dir);
  case 'torpCount':return p.torps.length===c.count;
  case 'torpedoResolved':return !!s&&events(context).filter(e=>e.text.includes(s.label)&&e.text.includes('发射鱼雷')).length===c.count;
  case 'planePoint':return p.planes.length===c.count&&p.planes.every(a=>a.mode==='point'&&same(E,a.target,c.cell));
  case 'aircraftAAResolved':return context.game.ships.find(x=>x.id===c.mother)?.destroyedPlanes>=1&&events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes('击落敌机'))&&!events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes('遭航空炸弹命中'));
  case 'sweep':return same(E,p.sweep,c.cell);
  case 'mineResolved':return !!s&&!context.game.map.mines.some(h=>same(E,h,c.cell))&&events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes(s.label)&&e.text.includes('副炮清雷'))&&!events(context).some(e=>e.text.includes('遭'+s.label+'副炮命中'));
  default:return false;
 }
}
function actionTypes(c) {return c.kind==='event'?c.types:c.kind==='all'?c.conditions.flatMap(actionTypes):[];}
export function evaluateTutorialStep(E,lessonId,stepIndex,context,action) {
 const lesson=TUTORIAL_LESSONS.find(x=>x.id===lessonId),current=lesson?.steps[stepIndex];
 if(!current)return {passed:false,relevant:false,feedback:''};
 const passed=match(E,current.condition,context,action);
 const relevant=actionTypes(current.condition).includes(action?.type)||['route','move','main','torpedo','plane','sweep','execute','roundComplete','redraw','truncate','undo','redo'].includes(action?.type);
 return {passed,relevant,feedback:passed?current.success:relevant?current.hint:''};
}
export function recordTutorialEvent(E,state,context,action) {
 if(state.complete)return {state:{...state},advanced:false,lessonComplete:true,feedback:''};
 const check=evaluateTutorialStep(E,state.lessonId,state.stepIndex,context,action),lesson=TUTORIAL_LESSONS.find(x=>x.id===state.lessonId);
 const next={...state,attempts:state.attempts+(check.relevant&&!check.passed?1:0),stepIndex:state.stepIndex+(check.passed?1:0)};
 next.complete=next.stepIndex>=lesson.steps.length;
 return {state:next,advanced:check.passed,lessonComplete:next.complete,feedback:check.feedback};
}

/* Fixtures contain real ships and resolve through the ordinary deterministic engine. */
export function createTutorialGame(E,lessonId) {
 const lesson=TUTORIAL_LESSONS.find(x=>x.id===lessonId);if(!lesson)throw new Error('Unknown tutorial lesson: '+lessonId);
 if(lessonId==='select-deploy')return {game:E.createGame(E.DEFAULT_ROSTER,20261004),plans:{},selected:'0-1',mode:'move',rangeMode:'secondary',showRanges:false,opponentPlans:{},tutorialOnly:true};
 const game=E.createGame(E.DEFAULT_ROSTER,20261004);game.phase='plan';game.map.islands=[];game.map.mines=[];game.planes=[];game.torpedoes=[];game.log=[];game.explored=[[],[]];game.ships=[];
 const make=(type,team,index,c,r,heading=team===0?0:3)=>{const s=E.createShip(type,team,index,E.fromCR(c,r));s.heading=heading;game.ships.push(s);return s;};
 const ownType=['turn-cost'].includes(lessonId)?'cl':['undo-redraw','main-save','mines'].includes(lessonId)?'bb':lessonId==='aircraft-aa'?'cv':'dd';
 make(ownType,0,0,5,10);make('bb',0,1,1,12);make('cl',0,2,0,13);make('ca',0,3,2,14);make('cv',0,4,0,12);
 make('ca',1,0,18,2);make('cv',1,1,16,3);
 const plans={},out={game,plans,selected:'0-0',mode:'move',rangeMode:'secondary',showRanges:false,opponentPlans:{},tutorialOnly:true};
 const assign=(id,moves=[],other={})=>plans[id]={...E.emptyPlan(),moves,...other};
 const replace=(id,type,c,r,heading=3)=>{const old=game.ships.find(x=>x.id===id),i=Number(id.split('-')[1]),s=E.createShip(type,old.team,i,E.fromCR(c,r));s.heading=heading;game.ships[game.ships.indexOf(old)]=s;return s;};
 if(lessonId==='undo-redraw')assign('0-0',[{turn:0,forward:true},{turn:0,forward:true}],{segments:[{start:0,end:1,target:E.fromCR(6,10)},{start:1,end:2,target:E.fromCR(7,10)}],main:[E.fromCR(11,10)]});
 if(lessonId==='timeline-collision'){
  replace('0-1','bb',7,10,3);assign('0-0',[{turn:0,forward:true}],{segments:[{start:0,end:1,target:E.fromCR(6,10)}],torps:[{window:1,dir:1}]});assign('0-1',[{turn:0,forward:true}],{segments:[{start:0,end:1,target:E.fromCR(6,10)}]});
 }
 if(lessonId==='fog-secondary'){replace('1-0','ca',8,10);replace('1-1','cv',11,10);}
 if(lessonId==='main-save')replace('1-0','ca',11,10);
 if(lessonId==='torpedo-windows')assign('0-0',[{turn:0,forward:true},{turn:0,forward:true}],{segments:[{start:0,end:2,target:E.fromCR(7,10)}]});
 if(lessonId==='aircraft-aa'){replace('1-0','dd',10,10);replace('1-1','ca',10,8);}
 if(lessonId==='mines'){game.map.mines=[E.fromCR(6,10)];replace('1-0','ca',7,10);}
 for(const s of game.ships.filter(x=>x.team===1))out.opponentPlans[s.id]=E.emptyPlan();
 E.updateExploration(game);return out;
}

